program: additions
define: TEST_CAPS
define: TEST_ADD_SEAL
emulators: bochs mame
match: contains
timeout: 120
---
additions: seal a fresh segment (0): 0
additions: the sealed code ran, AX (4660): 4660
additions: its access byte (251: readable code of DPL 3): 251
additions: seal it again (2): 2
additions: seal a segment a copy of which lives (6): 6
additions: seal the copy (6): 6
additions: seal a segment of DPL 2 (2): 2
additions: seal an endpoint (1): 1
child: running from a sealed segment
rx286: program fault #GP(0000) at 0007:{seal_part.write_f}
additions: done
